irements due to health issues. The existence of such specialized products reflects the community's commitment to addressing diverse dietary needs and ensuring that children receive adequate nutrition for their health and development. [Data: Entities (2477); Relationships (9979)]", "# Enteral Nutrition Community: SONDA ENTERAL and Associated Medications\n\nThe community focuses on enteral nutrition, primarily through the use of SONDA ENTERAL, an enteral feeding tube. Key entities include medications like Fenitoína and Dicumarínicos, which require careful administration alongside enteral nutrition. The relationships among these entities highlight the importance of monitoring and tailored medication delivery for patients unable to consume food orally.\n\n## SONDA ENTERAL as a critical medical device\n\nSONDA ENTERAL is essential for providing nutrition to patients who cannot eat orally. This enteral feeding tube allows for direct delivery of nutrients to the gastrointestinal tract, which is crucial for maintaining the health of patients with feeding difficulties. The significance of SONDA ENTERAL in the community is underscored by its relationships with various medications that require careful administration protocols. The effectiveness of enteral nutrition is directly linked to the proper use of this device, making it a cornerstone of the community's focus on patient care. [Data: Entities (1925), Relationships (2625, 6814, 7916, 7920, 7917, +more)]\n\n## Impact of Fenitoína on enteral nutrition\n\nFenitoína, an anticonvulsant medication, poses specific challenges when administered with enteral nutrition due to its narrow therapeutic range. The plasma levels of Fenitoína can be significantly reduced when given alongside enteral nutrition, necessitating close monitoring to ensure its effectiveness. This relationship highlights the need for healthcare providers to be vigilant when managing patients on enteral feeding, as improper administration could lead to inadequate s